---
description: How to publish to smartsolutionsai.us from Jayden (site-publish/ bridge)
alwaysApply: true
---
To publish to smartsolutionsai.us, follow SITE-PUBLISH.md at the repo root. Put files under
`site-publish/` at the same path they have in distassy-art/ss-unified-proto, then commit and push.
The publish-to-site workflow checks the files and publishes them. Never touch Cloudflare (no wrangler
or deploy scripts). Follow docs/INVENTORY-PUBLISH.md conventions. Never invent numbers.
No purchases for a day = purch 0 (never null). store_profit follows Excel's month margin: sales minus purchases, except when Excel's daily profit cell is blank (Charleston), in which case store_profit stays null.
